                Items&lt;/a&gt; for rules on deleting values when relisting items. Also see the
                relevant field descriptions to determine when to use &lt;b&gt;DeletedField&lt;/b&gt;
                (and potential consequences). The request can contain zero, one, or many instances
                of &lt;b&gt;DeletedField&lt;/b&gt; (one for each field to be deleted).
                &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Case-sensitivity must be taken into account when using a
