      <xs:element maxOccurs="unbounded" minOccurs="0" name="ShipToLocations" type="xs:string">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation> An international location or region to which the seller is willing to
            ship, regardless of shipping service. The country of the listing site is added by eBay.
            &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;span class="tablenote"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note: &lt;/b&gt; For
            sellers who are using a shipping (aka Fulfillment) business policy to
            create/revise/relist an item, the &lt;b&gt;ShipToLocations&lt;/b&gt; field should not be
