            class="tablenote"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note: &lt;/b&gt; The capability to create and use multiple
            domestic and international shipping rate tables (up to 40 per seller account) has rolled
            out to the US, Australia, Canada (English and French), Italy, UK, and Germany sites.
