            domestic regions and not just the special regions (such as Alaska &amp; Hawaii, US
            Protectorates, and APO/FPO locations in US).&lt;/span&gt; </xs:documentation>
          <xs:appinfo>
            <MaxLength>50</MaxLength>
            <CallInfo>
