            expedite the release of a payment hold. There can be one or more
            &lt;b&gt;RequiredSellerAction&lt;/b&gt; fields in the
            &lt;b&gt;RequiredSellerActionArray&lt;/b&gt; container. </xs:documentation>
          <xs:appinfo>
            <CallInfo>
              <CallName>GetOrders</CallName>
              <Details>DetailLevel: none</Details>
