            marketplaces, registered business sellers must accept returns for fixed-price items
            (including auction items with Buy It Now and any other fixed price formats) when the
            category requires a return policy. On some European sites, such as eBay Germany (DE),
            registered business sellers are required to accept returns. Use the Trading call
            &lt;b&gt;GetUser&lt;/b&gt; to determine the status of an eBay business seller in DE, IE,
            and UK. Review the &lt;b&gt;User.SellerInfo.SellerBusinessType&lt;/b&gt; field in the
            response. &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;span class="tablenote"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note:&lt;/b&gt;
