            (same-day shipping) or one-day shipping. Set the handling time (in days) using the
            &lt;b&gt;Item.DispatchTimeMax&lt;/b&gt; field.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt; Top-Rated
            listings qualify for the greatest average boost in Best Match and for the 20 percent
