            &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; The &lt;b&gt;WeightMajor&lt;/b&gt; and
            &lt;b&gt;WeightMinor&lt;/b&gt; are applicable for calculated shipping or for flat-rate
            shipping if shipping rate tables are specified and the shipping rate table uses weight
            surcharges. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; </xs:documentation>
          <xs:appinfo>
            <Min>0</Min>
            <Max>15 for ounces; 999 for grams</Max>
            <CallInfo>
              <CallName>AddFixedPriceItem</CallName>
              <CallName>AddItem</CallName>
              <CallName>AddItems</CallName>
              <CallName>RelistFixedPriceItem</CallName>
              <CallName>RelistItem</CallName>
