            &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;span class="tablenote"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt;
            The &lt;strong&gt;CalculatedShippingRate&lt;/strong&gt; container should only be used to
