          <xs:documentation> A shipping rate scale for shipping through USPS that affects the
            shipping cost calculated for USPS (lower if
            &lt;strong&gt;ShippingRateType&lt;/strong&gt; is &lt;code&gt;DailyPickup&lt;/code&gt;).
            &lt;strong&gt;ShippingRateType&lt;/strong&gt; is returned only if the value of
            &lt;strong&gt;ShippingService&lt;/strong&gt; is one of the USPS shipping services. For
            calculated shipping only. </xs:documentation>
