            high) order. </xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:enumeration>
      <xs:enumeration value="Descending">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation> The results will be sorted by the specified key in descending (high to
            low) order. </xs:documentation>
